  Play Icon

  Solid triangle with softened corners for media playback controls. Coordinates are offset so the
  triangle's bounding box sits centred in the 27x27 box, which the raw shape is not. Colour comes
  from the parent's text utility, so the path carries no fill of its own.

  @param {string} [class] - Sizing classes (optional)
{% enddoc %}

